thing troubling you?"}, {"start": 23.655, "end": 24.015, "text": "Nothing."}, {"start": 24.676, "end": 24.916, "text": "Good."}, {"start": 25.716, "end": 27.217, "text": "Let me take you through your results."}, {"start": 28.098, "end": 28.638, "text": "Please do."}, {"start": 29.342, "end": 32.925, "text": "Your long-term sugar value is 42 millimoles per mole."}, {"start": 33.586, "end": 34.686, "text": "Is that where you would want it?"}, {"start": 35.327, "end": 35.707, "text": "It is."}, {"start": 36.448, "end": 38.129, "text": "And your lipids have improved as well."}, {"start": 38.79, "end": 39.671, "text": "That is good to hear."}, {"start": 40.311, "end": 44.535, "text": "Taken together, your diabetes and your lipids are both well controlled."}, {"start": 45.215, "end": 46.496, "text": "So nothing needs adjusting?"}, {"start": 47.337, "end": 47.737, "text": "Nothing."}, {"start": 48.398, "end": 50.9, "text": "The plan is that you continue your current treatment."}, {"start": 51.681, "end": 52.882, "text": "Exactly as it is now?"}, {"start": 53.602, "end": 54.623, "text": "Exactly as it is."}, {"start": 55.163, "end": 56.505, "text": "No changes from me today."}, {"start": 57.145, "end": 58.106, "text": "That is straightforward."}, {"start": 58.686, "end": 59.046, "text": "It is."}, {"start": 59.807, "end": 61.749, "text": "Do you have any questions before we finish?"}, {"start": 62.569, "end": 64.051, "text": "No, I do not think so."}, {"start": 64.691, "end": 64.951, "text": "Good."}, {"start": 65.712, "end": 67.694, "text": "Was the supermarket busy on your way in?"}, {"start": 68.354, "end": 69.555, "text": "It usually is at this hour."}, {"start": 70.196, "end": 70.516, "text": "Very."}, {"start": 71.357, "end": 72.618, "text": "I left the shopping for later."}, {"start": 73.358, "end": 73.779, "text": "Wise."}, {"start": 74.599, "end": 75.4, "text": "Take care, Nana."}, {"start": 76.001, "end": 76.721, "text": "Thank you, Doctor."}, {"start": 77.122, "end": 77.502, "text": "Goodbye."}], "machine": "gpu59.int.triton.aalto.fi", "git_commit": "735eed3a1a4f5d8bc8a3ac1f1c8897e291443b9f", "date": "2026-09-20", "timing_s": {"transcribe_and_align": 1.559}}